                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">9</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">26</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">日上午，绍兴市直、柯桥区、上虞区等三区选考（学考）适应性考试分析会在我校举行，市教育教学研究院院长和分管副院长、柯桥区教师发展中心和上虞区教研室分管高中的领导、三区各普通高中业务校长、市直高中教务主任、市教育教学研究院相关学科高中教研员等共</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">30</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">余人人参加。我校卢燎亚、俞建种、戴军熔等学校领导也参加了本次会议。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">在对</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">9</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">月份绍兴市组织的选考（学考）适应性考试情况分析的基础上，七位相关科目的市高中教研员在把握复习方向、调整复习策略、加强解题指导等方面给出了自己的建议。随后，王黎明副院长就本次适应性考试作总体情况分析，建议学校及时调整教学管理理念、重视课程建设与师资建设的通盘考量、基于高考招生制度的改革处理好学考与选考的关系，以科研的视角致力于教学新常态的构建。接着，我校与春晖中学、钱清中学的分管校长，基于本校实际分析了本届高三的教学管理历程和存在的问题，分享了成功的经验和后阶段的计划。最后，市教育教学研究院吕华荣院长从学科教学和学校管理两个维度提出了建议，要求学科教学要明确方向、强化诊断、改进课堂、分析学情、精选资料，重在落实；在学校管理上，要更新观念适应新高考、抓好课程建设与管理、加强部门协调抓关键、重视起始年级的规划与教学、加强评价促发展的研究。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">本次考试情况分析会，基于实践与研究，安排紧凑，内容丰富，实现了教学研究与教学管理的充分对接，增进了三区教学信息的有效共享。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #111111; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 322pt; mso-char-indent-count: 23.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">（校办供稿）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
